        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:1.0625rem; line-height:1.85; margin-bottom:1.25rem;"><strong>Fraud is a massive, ongoing cost.</strong> Insurance fraud is estimated to cost the industry hundreds of billions of dollars annually across all lines. AI models trained on claims patterns catch fraud indicators that manual review at scale simply can't.</p>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:1.0625rem; line-height:1.85;"><strong>Underwriting speed is a competitive advantage.</strong> Customers increasingly expect a quote in minutes, not days. AI-assisted risk scoring speeds up underwriting while keeping every decision explainable to a regulator.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="split-media">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1773126378915-793b5c48fb38?w=800&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Couple reviewing and signing an insurance policy document at a desk" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT LENOO BUILDS -->
