    <div class="apps-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">assignment</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Claims Intake &amp; Document Processing</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Extracts and validates data from claim forms, photos, and supporting documents automatically, routing straightforward claims for fast approval.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Cuts manual data entry for the majority of routine claims</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">verified</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Automated Underwriting Risk Scoring</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Scores applicant risk using policy and, where available, alternative data, with every output documented for compliance review.</p>
