        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Answers policy questions, provides claims status updates, and handles renewal reminders in Arabic and English, around the clock.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Reduces call center volume for routine policy questions</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">description</span></div>
