        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">forum</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Customer Self-Service Chatbots</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Chatbots handle policy questions, claims status, and renewal reminders, reducing call volume for routine, repetitive customer requests.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Standard first AI deployment for most insurers</p>
      </div>
