        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Telematics and connected-device data feed models that price policies based on actual behavior rather than broad demographic categories.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Growing fastest in auto and health insurance lines</p>
      </div>
